    "title": "Boston Red Sox Defeat Toronto Blue Jays Amid AL Playoff Race",
    "text": "Trending Story\nUpdated 04:19 AM UTC, Thu September 25, 2025\nBoston Red Sox Defeat Toronto Blue Jays Amid AL Playoff Race\nThe New York Yankees clinched a postseason birth with a 3-2 comeback win against the Chicago White Sox on Tuesday night. New York becomes the second team in the American League to clinch a playoff spot, behind the Toronto Blue Jays. They also seek to return to back-to-back World Series appearances for the first time […] The post Gutsy Yankees Clinch Postseason Birth In Walk-Off Fashion appeared first on Stadium Rant .\nConor Ryan\n\"The top priority for the Red Sox is to simply punch their ticket to the postseason for the first time since 2021.\"",
